  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Method 1 is correct and already takes om times n time.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 6240,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 187,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "The extra cost comes from the visited matrix.",
      "start_ms": 6780,
      "end_ms": 9980,
      "start_frame": 203,
      "end_frame": 299,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Now look at our matrix.",
      "start_ms": 10440,
      "end_ms": 11680,
      "start_frame": 313,
      "end_frame": 350,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "After the full outer layer has been processed, see what remains.",
      "start_ms": 12300,
      "end_ms": 16900,
      "start_frame": 369,
      "end_frame": 507,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "It is still one rectangle.",
      "start_ms": 17300,
      "end_ms": 18960,
      "start_frame": 519,
      "end_frame": 569,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "That gives us a better idea.",
      "start_ms": 19860,
      "end_ms": 21580,
      "start_frame": 596,
      "end_frame": 647,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Instead of remembering every processed cell, we can simply remember which rectangle is still unprocessed.",
      "start_ms": 22300,
      "end_ms": 30800,
      "start_frame": 669,
      "end_frame": 924,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "And one rectangle needs only four boundaries.",
      "start_ms": 30880,
      "end_ms": 33440,
      "start_frame": 926,
      "end_frame": 1003,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Top, bottom, left and right.",
      "start_ms": 33940,
      "end_ms": 36780,
      "start_frame": 1018,
      "end_frame": 1103,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "So we can replace an entire visited matrix with four integers.",
      "start_ms": 37260,
      "end_ms": 42920,
      "start_frame": 1118,
      "end_frame": 1288,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "That gives us Method 2.",
      "start_ms": 43960,
      "end_ms": 45400,
      "start_frame": 1319,
      "end_frame": 1362,
      "word_count": 5
    }
  ],
